    <section class="product-details-section py-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="description-wrapper mb-3">
                <div class="row ">
                    <div class="col-lg-12">
                        <div class="description-tabs">
                            <ul class="nav nav-tabs">
                                <li class="nav-item">
                                    <a class="nav-link active" data-toggle="tab" href="#Mission">Mission</a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="nav-item">
                                    <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#Vision">Vision</a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="nav-item">
                                    <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#History">History</a>
                                </li>
                                <li class="nav-item">
                                    <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#Unique">Unique</a>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tab-content mt-30">
                            <div id="Mission" class="tab-pane fade show active">
                                <div class="description-content-box">
                                    <p>At Cat Pedigree World, we recognized the challenges breeders face worldwide in sourcing new bloodlines for their catteries. We also observed the absence of a comprehensive, globally-oriented website to facilitate these needs. This inspired us to create a user-friendly platform where everyone can connect to buy or sell cats—the ultimate destination for pedigree cat enthusiasts. Here, you can discover beautiful and unique breeds with pedigrees from around the globe. We hope you enjoy using our website as much as we enjoyed creating it.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="Vision" class="tab-pane fade">
                                <div class="description-content-box">
                                    <p>At CatPedigreeWorld, our pride is deeply rooted in what we've built for both customers and breeders alike. Our commitment to your privacy is unwavering—we treat your data with the utmost respect and guarantee it will never be shared with external parties. When you entrust us with your pedigree information, be assured that all sensitive data is promptly removed to protect your confidentiality. We're dedicated to maintaining a vibrant and welcoming online space, vigilantly overseeing our site and its users to ensure a sense of belonging and comfort for all. Every concern is met with serious attention and a proactive approach to resolution. For us at CatPedigreeWorld, it's paramount that our site remains a sanctuary where both users and breeders feel at ease and valued.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="History" class="tab-pane fade">
                                <div class="description-content-box">
                                    <p>Catpedigreeworld was born out of a need for a global platform that simplifies finding and sharing cat pedigrees. Frustrated by the lack of international focus and the tedious process of sourcing new genetic lines for breeders, we created a one-stop website. Here, breeders and cat enthusiasts can easily access pedigrees, complete with breeder contacts and origins, facilitating the search for the perfect kitten or enhancing breeding programs. We ensure all listings are verified and registered with reputable associations, making pedigree submission quick and expanding our database for a better user experience.</p>
                                    <p>Do you want to learn more about the history of Catpedigreeworld? <a href="@Url.Action("WhyCatPedigree","Home")" style="color: red;">Click Here!</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="Unique" class="tab-pane fade">
                                <div class="description-content-box">
                                    <p>At Catpedigreeworld, our pride in extending our services across the globe is matched only by our commitment to ensuring that, no matter your locale, our comprehensive offerings are just a click away. Recognizing the beauty and diversity of our global community, we've meticulously tailored our services to be fully inclusive, transcending language barriers to provide support in multiple languages. This steadfast commitment to worldwide accessibility and multilingual assistance is a testament to our unwavering dedication to serving cat enthusiasts and breeders in every corner of the world.</p>
                                    <p><a href="@Url.Action("WhyCatPedigree","Home")" style="color: red;">Click here to read more.</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
             
        </div>
    </section>
