                            </div>
                            <div class="box-desc">
                                <h5 style="color: black !important;font-weight: bold !important;">Patrick</h5>
                                <span>CEO</span>
                                <p>My wife has been breeding Russian Blues for over twenty years and that inspired me to create this website. Also finding new blood for our cattery was always a big problem and a lot of work. That is also the reason we have the pedigree category, so you can see and find your new bloodline with one click of a button. I hope you will benefit from this website as much as we do. So that you can find your furry friend.</p>
                            </div>
