                                <img class="img-fluid" src="/webassets/images/team/person-C.png" alt="..." width="200" />
                            </div>
                            <div class="box-desc">
                                <h5 style="color: black !important;font-weight: bold !important;">Wendy</h5>
                                <span>CCO</span>
                                <p>Twenty years ago, a Russian Blue cat captured my heart, sparking my journey into breeding these and the stunning Russian Whites. Proudly, I was among the first in Europe to breed Russian Whites, showcasing them at top exhibitions. This website was born from my eagerness to share my love and knowledge of these beautiful cats with enthusiasts around the world. With two decades of breeding experience, I'm thrilled to provide insights into the world of Russian Blues and Whites.</p>
                            </div>
                           <ul class="social pt-2 d-none">
