                            <div class="image-wrapper mb-3">
                                <img class="img-fluid" src="/webassets/images/team/person-B.png" alt="..." width="300"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="box-desc">
                                <h5 style="color: black !important;font-weight: bold !important;">Niels</h5>
                                <span>CMO - COO</span>
                                <p>Having had dogs in my home for many years, I've recently become a big fan of Bengal cats. At Catpedigreeworld, I bring my expertise in management, customer service, logistics and marketing to the table, working hard to ensure that our platform is a success for all users.</p>
