                            <div class="image-wrapper mb-3">
                                <img class="img-fluid" src="/webassets/images/team/person-D.png" alt="..." width="300"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="box-desc">
                                <h5 style="color: black !important;font-weight: bold !important;">Osman</h5>
                                <span>CFO</span>
                                <p>For over 20 years, I have seen my friends with these lovely Blue Russian kittens. I adore these cats so much. They are such fascinating animals. There are many different kinds of cats around the world. My friend Patrick and I decided to create this website to bring all cat lovers together on one platform where you can find everything you need to know about cats. We hope that you enjoy it.</p>
